Confirm no remaining same-class caller passes the plugin root as `--repo-root` when a consumer repo is available. Do not refactor `design_postplan.py`, `plan_review.py`, `design_lifecycle.py`, or `plan_quality.py` unless the audit finds an actual same-class defect.

